r</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1818400">Pirimid</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21010_763876_3074388"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The overall design of a page or content set, including text elements, controls, and graphics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763876">layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3074388">leagan amach</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21012_1135481_1520286"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The descriptive information about a user that is shown to other users. This editable information is separate from the registration information they provide to establish their Windows Live account. This separation allows users to disclose or conceal personal information as they choose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1135481">Windows Live Profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520286">próifíl</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21012_763878_1520286"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The descriptive information about a user that is shown to other users. This editable information is separate from the registration information they provide to establish their Windows Live account. This separation allows users to disclose or conceal personal information as they choose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763878">profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520286">próifíl</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21015_2392175_3104256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email address to which password reset information can be sent if a customer forgets the password portion of their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2392175">alternate email address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104256">Ríomhphost Malartach</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21015_3103949_3104256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email address to which password reset information can be sent if a customer forgets the password portion of their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103949">alternate email</term><t