L page with sufficient fidelity to convey text and images on a small screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1048367">Word Mobile Viewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1522687">Amharcóir Móibíleach Word</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2257_183896_1260784"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables the user to compact or collapse rows when viewing several levels of data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183896">compact row axis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1260784">ais dlúthaithe ró</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22595_1050253_1261144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows Media Player (WMP) specific feature that allows you to use the Internet to access music, pictures and videos available on your home network. The feature must be activated on at least two computers in order to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1050253">remote media connection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1261144">cian-nasc meán</term><termNot