es (IIS) virtual server and port used for SharePoint Central Administration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="558978">administration port</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1095386">port riaracháin</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29250_1506846_1944206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A specialized component of a full-text index catalog that is built on the values of scoped properties for optimized queries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506846">search scope index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944206">innéacs scóip an chuardaigh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29251_1506847_1944207"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An attribute that specifies which items are included in a given search scope.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506847">search scope rule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944207">riail scóip an chuardaigh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</ter