ist that identifies which assemblies and types are allowed to run on Web Parts pages in a server farm. The list is stored in the web.config file for the server farm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508557">SafeControl list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1818577">liosta Slán-Rialaithe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29455_1508759_1818578"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A measure whose value is calculated at run time by using an expression.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508759">calculated measure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1818578">tomhas ríofa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29459_1508807_1818579"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The folder in which various translated files are stored. Each language has a different subfolder that corresponds to its locale identification number (LCID). For example, in a U.S. English installation, the LCID is 1033.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508807">language folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1818579">fillteán