e determination of a price tier’s price that is shown in another currency.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1632112">price tier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1644723">leibhéal praghsanna</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32068_1634055_1818672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of system resources that are allowed to be used by a block of code. Usage that exceeds this amount results in an error.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1634055">resource budget</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1818672">buiséad acmhainní</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32074_1634273_1695954"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The email address of the account responsible for maintaining services on a mail server that often responds to problems account holders have in sending or receiving email.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1634273">postmaster@mail.hotmail.com</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1695954">postmaster@mail.hotmail.com</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><t