d</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="514438">nasc</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42885_2432491_2436827"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that allows users to use ink to highlight content using their mouse, finger, or an inking tool, and whose ink resembles a traditional highlighter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432491">highlighter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436827">aibhsitheoir</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42886_2432492_2436826"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To create, highlight, or erase content using ink.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432492">draw</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436826">tarraing</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42887_2432493_2436829"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that allows users to use ink to draw using their mouse, finger, or an inking tool, and whose ink resembles pencil graphite.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432493">pencil</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436829">peann luaidhe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42888_2432494_2436828"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that allows users to use ink to draw using their mouse, finger, or an inking tool, and whose ink resembles traditional pen ink.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432494">pen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436828">peann</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42889_2432495_2436832"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that is activated when clicked once, and when clicked a second time, opens a menu that allows the user to modify the mode of the selected tool.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432495">secondary action button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436832">gníomhchnaipe tánaisteach</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gra