 that allows users to track campaigns across the champion group to see their ranking from a global perspective.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055644">Champion Leaderboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055998">Clár Ceann Riain na gCuradh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53676_3055644_3056001"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Champion Management Platform that allows users to track campaigns across the champion group to see their ranking from a global perspective.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055644">Champion Leaderboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056001">Clár Ceann Riain</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53676_3055645_3055998"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Champion Management Platform that allows users to track campaigns across the champion group to see their ranking from a global perspective.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055645">Leaderboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="305