 the normal behavior of a system, environment, process, workflow or person; any observable occurrence in a system or network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097234">security event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3098419">teagmhas slándála</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54313_3097235_3098440"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An automated notification resulting from a detection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097235">security alert</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3098440">foláireamh slándála</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54314_3097236_3098441"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Engagement of the Microsoft incident response team via formal engagement procedures indicating a potential security issue that requires investigation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097236">security escalation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ga-IE"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3098441">géarú slándála</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IRL</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote t